# --- Your real financial data — NEVER commit this ---
# All CSVs in data/ are ignored except the synthetic samples.
data/*.csv
!data/Transactions.sample.csv
!data/Transactions.sample-detailed.csv
# App backups (real data): "Export backup" downloads and the pre-restore safety snapshot
koin-backup-*.json
koin-before-restore-*.json
# (Real data also lives outside the repo, in local browser storage / a chosen backup file.)

# --- Internal review notes (kept locally, not published) ---
# Point-in-time architecture/security reviews. Their outcomes are recorded in CHANGELOG.md
# and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md; the raw notes read as a list of current weaknesses long after
# they're fixed, so they stay out of the public repo.
docs/REVIEW-*.md

# --- Secrets (defensive: this repo has none, and must never gain any) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# --- Machine-specific tooling ---
# launch.json contains absolute paths; keep it local.
.claude/launch.json
# Per-machine Claude Code settings/state (the shared settings.json IS committed).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/state/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Node / build tooling ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
dist/
# vite-plugin-pwa's dev-mode service-worker output (only when devOptions.enabled)
dev-dist/
